    <div class="cav">The plain-English version</div>
    <h1>What Are <em>AI Agent Skills</em>, and What Are They Actually For?</h1>
    <p class="dek">A skill is a folder with a Markdown file in it. That is genuinely the whole format. What makes it interesting is the loading trick underneath, the six fields that travel between tools, and the fact that a quarter of the ones published have something wrong with them.</p>
